# Settings `/settings`

- Single owner profile and preferences. No user switcher and no sample profile.
- Persist only settings the app consumes: theme, locale/timezone, and supported notifications. Theme key: `project-management-theme`.
- Security tab: only controls backed by a real authentication provider or API. Do not accept password or 2FA input and discard it.
- Save and validation feedback. Cancel restores the last persisted values. No role-specific or multi-user settings.
- Target: `GET/PATCH /api/settings/me`. Hide or disable save controls that do not persist.
- Shared sidebar + `PAGE_MAIN`. Scrollable tabs and stacked forms on phone. Light/dark/special-dark share solid-button contrast.
- Out until a provider is chosen: custom password/2FA implementation, org-wide policy console, unintegrated notification channels.
